{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56554","headline":"还丹歌 二三 · 杨行真人","name":"还丹歌 二三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"二精合会，还丹之心。\n若逢此理，不假远寻。\n黑铅取阳，朱砂取阴。\n（《还丹歌诀》卷上。\n）（按：快乐组诗第一首前四句与杨玄一诗几全同，颇疑二人爲同一人。\n姑分列。\n俟续考。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨行真人","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56554.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56554","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}